<title>UK: Scottish TV post-excep profits 61.2 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Scottish TV post-excep profits 61.2 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		31.0		   vs 27.4</p>
